@node "Introducti" "Introduction"
@{b}Introduction@{ub}

Sceptic Conference Statistics is a multi-purpose bulletin creator
door, which runs during the examine process.

Well ... just have a look on the @{"FEATURES" link "Features" 0} and you`ll be amazed!

                                    @{"Main Menu" link "Main" 0}
@endnode
@node "Features" "Features"
@{b}Features@{ub}

 · Sceptic Conference Statistics runs during examination.
 · Can create conftop, weektop, uploads today seperated for each conf.
 · Excellent output design, again thanks to Mogue/Arclite.
 · Easy to configure - Tooltypes are used.

                                    @{"Main Menu" link "Main" 0}
@endnode

@node "Install" "Installation to /X"
@{b}Installation@{ub}

1) Make a dir  named: "DOORS:SCEPTIC" and copy the dir "F!-FIDEnhance" to
   this location.

2) Copy the "EXAMINE<x>.info" to your SYSCMD/EXAMINE<x>.info

   Make sure to update the tooltypes in F!-START.INFO if you (and you will)
   change the name of EXAMINE<x>.info !!!

3) Copy the "SENT.info" to your BBSCMD/SENT.info

4) Copy the Dir "F!-START" + F!-Start.info to "doors:sceptic"

   If you have already installed F!-START then copy the Tooltypes from
   this infofile to the previously installed one!

5) Configure the tooltypes...

   ToolType "ALLTIME.X=<path/bulletin>"  - Write conftop bulletin for conf x
                                           to file <path/file>.

   ToolType "WEEKTOP.X=<path/bulletin>"  - Write weektop bulletin for conf x
                                           to file <path/file>.

   ToolType "NEWFILES.X=<path/bulletin>" - Write todayul bulletin for conf x
                                           to file <path/file>.

   ToolType "Eall=YES/NO"                - Enables/Disables sending of the eall
                                           message at the end of the week.


  In public version only the weektop bull will be created - register !!!


                                  @{"Main Menu" link "Main" 0}
