@node "Registration" "Registration details - taken from SAD-GDRG.TXT"

REGISTERING
~~~~~~~~~~~
From  now  on  i  take  a small fee for a MULTI REGISTRATION KEYFILE which will
register all my doors to you (the name in the keyfile).

You`ll  get  all  my  new  doors without registering up to V1.o but bugfixed or
enhanced  versions  are  NOT  given  to the PUBLIC anymore!  If a reg.  user is
spreading  them,  well ...  I don`t mind ..  because the doors from v1.o+ won`t
run without a REAL KEYFILE!

What  to  do  is a simple trick:  Send me DM30 / $US20 / £15 and you`ll receive
your own keyfile.

My address is: Sebastian Bergmann, Aulgasse 14, 53721 Siegburg, Germany !!!

               Don't abuse my address, means no illegal activities and so on,
               i was, am and will ever be a LEGAL SCENE DUDE !!!

GraveDancer


